    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d346">

                <pb facs="0617" n="489" sameAs="frus:frus1928v01/pg489"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">763.72113 Au 7/36</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Alien Property Custodian</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Sutherland</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-10-15"><hi rendition="#italic">October 15,
                        1928</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: Replying to your communication of October
                        13th,<anchor n="42" xml:id="d346-f1"/> with which you enclosed a copy of the
                    communication from His Excellency, the Austrian Minister,<anchor n="43"
                        xml:id="d346-f2"/> which has reference to the transferring of funds
                    belonging to the Austrian Government, including the K. K. Oesterreichische Tabak
                    Regie (Austrian Tobacco Monopoly).</p>
                <p>You are advised that I have ordered the necessary procedure to be taken to comply
                    with this request.</p>
                <p>Very truly yours,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Howard Sutherland</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
